Z||000015||mwbackus||10-01-1999||07:35 PM||||     If my observations are correct, the coveted "Type-R" and "VTECH" stickers have the best size to hp ratio. All three letter stickers such as HKS, NOS, K&N, KYB, and MSD offer equivalent performance gains.  <P>     It is important to note that any type of "Motorsports" windshield banner combined with extremely large exhaust tips can give quarter mile times well within the 9's.<P>     Factory stickers offer no performance advantage over stock, although removal may degrade performance somewhat.<P>:-)<p>[This message has been edited by mwbackus (edited 10-01-1999).]||||reg||7
