Z||000018||Lynx||10-05-1999||04:50 AM||||No it will do no power improvement mabye .001HP and they really arent that reusable because you have to buy the cleaning and oiling kits so your better of just buying cheap FRAM filters all the time, NO HASSLE cleaning. And if you really think they can make more power, pull your filter out and run around the block. Thats would be no restriction at all and i bet you notice nothing. But if they sell the K&N sticker buy it. I bought the sticker and it gave me a 30HP boost and all the High School kids and there Civic's think my car is WAY fast.||||reg||1
Z||000019||DJRice||10-05-1999||08:55 AM||||The Nike 'swoosh' sticker, when applied to the rear windshield, will have a negative effect on the Fiero brakes.  This effect is probably directly proportional to the size of the sticker.  <P>I was in Orlando last week in my Grand Cherokee stopped at a red light when I heard brakes lock up behind me.  Boy was I surprised to see that I was almost rear-ended by a Fiero.  When he passed me, I noticed he had a sizeable Iridiscent(?) Nike swoosh on his back window.<P>The funny thing is, that If the guy would have wacked me, and seriously damaged his car, I probably would have offered him a couple hundred dollars for it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||10
